   "narrated": "Narrated Aishah (ra):",
   "text": "I heard the Prophet (ﷺ), \"Souls are like recruited troops: Those who are like qualities are inclined to each other, but those who have dissimilar qualities, differ.\"",
   "english_full": "Narrated Aishah (ra):\nI heard the Prophet (ﷺ), \"Souls are like recruited troops: Those who are like qualities are inclined to each other, but those who have dissimilar qualities, differ.\"",
